* =========================================================================
* DAB Converter - LTspice Simulation
* =========================================================================
* Dual Active Bridge (DAB) for V2G Application
* 3.3 kW, 350V/400V, 50 kHz, SiC MOSFETs
* =========================================================================
*
* INSTRUCTIONS:
* 1. Open this file in LTspice XVII
* 2. Run transient simulation: .tran 0 200u 100u 10n
* 3. Plot: V(Vpri), V(Vsec), I(L1) for key waveforms
*
* NOTE: SiC MOSFETs are modeled as ideal switches with Rds(on)
* For more accuracy, use manufacturer SPICE models from Wolfspeed
* =========================================================================

* === Power Supply (Battery Side) ===
V1 Vbat 0 350

* === Power Supply (DC Bus Side) ===
V2 Vdc 0 400

* === Primary Full Bridge (H-Bridge 1) ===
* Q1-Q4 form the primary bridge
* Using ideal switches with Rds(on) = 65 mOhms

* Gate drive signals (50 kHz, 50% duty, complementary)
* Primary bridge: no phase shift
V_G1 gate1 0 PULSE(0 15 0 10n 10n {0.5/50000-200n} {1/50000})
V_G2 gate2 0 PULSE(0 15 {0.5/50000} 10n 10n {0.5/50000-200n} {1/50000})

* Secondary bridge: phase shifted by phi = 30 degrees = T/12
V_G3 gate3 0 PULSE(0 15 {1/(50000*12)} 10n 10n {0.5/50000-200n} {1/50000})
V_G4 gate4 0 PULSE(0 15 {0.5/50000+1/(50000*12)} 10n 10n {0.5/50000-200n} {1/50000})

* Primary Bridge MOSFETs (using voltage-controlled switches)
S1 Vbat  Vpri_a gate1 0 MOSFET
S2 0     Vpri_a gate2 0 MOSFET
S3 Vbat  Vpri_b gate2 0 MOSFET
S4 0     Vpri_b gate1 0 MOSFET

* Secondary Bridge MOSFETs
S5 Vdc   Vsec_a gate3 0 MOSFET
S6 0     Vsec_a gate4 0 MOSFET
S7 Vdc   Vsec_b gate4 0 MOSFET
S8 0     Vsec_b gate3 0 MOSFET

* MOSFET model (SiC approximation)
.model MOSFET SW(Ron=65m Roff=1Meg Vt=2.4 Vh=0.5)

* === Transformer + Leakage Inductance ===
* Turns ratio 1:1, leakage inductance = 85 uH
* Modeled as ideal transformer + series inductance

* Primary winding voltage
L1 Vpri_a Vpri_mid 42.5u
K1 L1 L2 1

* Secondary winding voltage
L2 Vsec_a Vsec_mid 42.5u

* Additional leakage (total = 85 uH referred to primary)
* Split between primary and secondary for symmetry

* Connect transformer secondary
R_pri Vpri_mid Vpri_b 0.05
R_sec Vsec_mid Vsec_b 0.05

* === Output Filter ===
C_out Vdc 0 10u IC=400
R_load Vdc 0 {400*400/3300}

* === Input Filter ===
C_in Vbat 0 10u IC=350

* === Simulation Commands ===
.tran 0 200u 100u 10n
.options reltol=0.001
.options method=gear

* === Measurement ===
.meas TRAN P_avg AVG -V(Vbat)*I(V1) FROM 150u TO 200u
.meas TRAN I_rms RMS I(L1) FROM 150u TO 200u
.meas TRAN I_peak MAX I(L1) FROM 150u TO 200u
.meas TRAN V_out_avg AVG V(Vdc) FROM 150u TO 200u
.meas TRAN efficiency PARAM P_avg/{400*400/48.48}

* =========================================================================
* NOTES:
* - Phase shift is set to 30° (T/12 delay on secondary gate signals)
* - To change phase shift: modify the delay in V_G3 and V_G4
*   phi_degrees * T_sw / 360 = delay time
*   e.g., 45° = 2.5 µs delay at 50 kHz
* - For V2G operation: swap V_G1↔V_G3 and V_G2↔V_G4 delays
* - Replace ideal switches with Wolfspeed C3M0065100K SPICE model
*   for accurate loss estimation
* =========================================================================

.end
